+  Block `sessions_spawn` calls that omit `agentId`. Native cron callers default to requiring an explicit non-requester target. ACP cron callers may use a distinct `acp.defaultAgent`, but cannot implicitly or explicitly target their own profile unless this setting is `false`. Denials list allowed non-requester targets. Per-agent override: `agents.entries.*.subagents.requireAgentId`.
